  "basis": "S5b-1: a material's product is decided from the clause filing code its terms print and the full product name its title carries (checked on 39 materials of 13 products, 2026-10-24). Product types follow the filed name suffix after trailing qualifiers such as (分红型) are removed; 养老年金 is an annuity (user 2026-10-18). New products get an id generated from the clause filing code (user 2026-10-24). 2026-10-24.2 (review R3): a clause code starts with a listed issuer, so a label printed before it is never taken into the code.",
